 \u00e1rboles, Trocha Shihuahuaco, escalada en Clibing a una plataforma lupuna, y en la misma Hacienda Herrera.\nAdem\u00e1s 4 videos con contenido exclusivo de c\u00e1maras trampa en la selva de madre de Dios.", "short_description": "Primer aplicativo con recorridos 360\u00b0 de la selva en Puerto Maldonado"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "logo-512.png", "id": "2055343438150768", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57572927_2055343441484101_8652722561279519607_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=49Y8epvF5jIQ7kNvwHD7tNE&_nc_oc=AdqVmm-SIibg19uYzul5sonq26yq4pWp2ws7oLLsZ9vgueYNdH3IxsvPsa92cMo8bQU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT2pqC3tstrGQ_3iDuyNT8TxkTdg8ob8ESkN3I70L4q0g&oe=6B086AD4"}, {"file_name": "1440 HH.png", "id": "1725009814685831", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57570294_1725009818019164_2794798217413603034_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6BakDaIm7iIQ7kNvwGEQ9DS&_nc_oc=Adr2T7oumUJNN1gYsFMyArUFBV_V3C6kQJO3pgczu-UZNxARNRDp2Y4nuEcoEYPMF4U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQdkM53a9ONSerA_0jOKAUmWqBw8PZ7SZHkq0RswahpKg&oe=6B08611D"}, {"file_name": "7x10HH.png", "id": "1264346464967416", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031597_1264346468300749_4624995628890807215_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0T9oO-UzdRcQ7kNvwFOaT-Y&_nc_oc=AdoBNFNF6HMVTuwCJuaRpaj30m1VIjPbv0hYq_FQWbVIvjAvKOnCHkKBMg7UF8ekr-I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ8VPTPq8kJMSgRW2lGLqqKxn6j5vefK1Jii69IoZ-Sew&oe=6B085534"}, {"file_name": "Mesa de trabajo 3hherrera.png", "id": "705420821469944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-2